COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_competitive_position.detection_basis IS 'Displayed promotion start or prior assortment observation upper-bound basis.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_competitive_position.channel_basis IS 'Distinguishes national all-channel price rows from source-observed promotion/assortment channels.';

-- ---------- gold_market_share (Market Analysis PR 2) ----------
COMMENT ON TABLE ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share IS 'Current licensed market benchmark cells at provider market-definition, geography, category, non-total subject and provider-period grain. Total-category cells supply denominators internally and are not served. Stable cells resolve append-only restatements by provider update, observation and load timestamps.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.benchmark_cell_id IS 'Stable logical cell identity shared across original and restated deliveries.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.market_benchmark_id IS 'Current delivered-version identity selected for the stable benchmark cell.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.source_observation_id IS 'Source identity of the selected delivered cell version.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.record_source IS 'Licensed benchmark source namespace; methodology and usage rights remain source-specific.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.market_definition IS 'Measured store/channel universe supplied by the source; a share number is not meaningful without it.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.geography_level IS 'Provider geography hierarchy level: total, region, market, key_account or account_market.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.geography_code IS 'Provider or adopter identifier at geography_level.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.category_ref IS 'Adopter-owned mapping from the benchmark category to the own merchandising hierarchy.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.subject_type IS 'Served subject: own banner, competitor banner, brand or private label; total-category cells are denominator-only inputs.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.subject_id IS 'Source identifier for the served non-total subject.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.competitor_id IS 'Durable BMV competitor key when a competitor-banner subject is mapped.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.competitor_name IS 'Competitor display name effective at provider period end.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.period_type IS 'Provider period vocabulary; never relabeled as an own fiscal period.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.period_end_date IS 'Provider-defined period end date used for stable-cell grain and period-end display-name resolution.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.currency_code IS 'ISO 4217 reporting currency for benchmark monetary measures.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.market_share_sales_amount IS 'Additive measured sales for this subject cell; numerator for market share.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.market_size_sales_amount IS 'Matching total-category sales; denominator for market share.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.subject_unit_volume IS 'Measured unit volume for the selected subject cell.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.market_size_unit_volume IS 'Matching total-category unit volume.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.market_share_pct IS '100 x subject sales / matching total-category sales. NULL when the denominator cell is unavailable.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.provider_reported_market_share_pct IS 'Provider-reported share retained for reconciliation; non-additive and not averaged by the metric view.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.provider_reported_market_growth_rate_pct IS 'Provider-reported growth retained without recomputation across restatements.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.eq_volume IS 'Optional provider-supplied equivalized volume.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.acv_weighted_distribution_pct IS 'Optional provider-supplied importance-weighted distribution percentage; non-additive.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.numeric_distribution_pct IS 'Optional provider-supplied outlet-count-weighted distribution percentage; non-additive.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.tdp IS 'Optional provider-supplied total distribution points.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.promo_sales_amount IS 'Optional provider-supplied sales attributed to promotional conditions.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.base_sales_amount IS 'Optional provider-supplied sales attributed to base conditions.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.is_restatement IS 'TRUE when the selected current delivery revised an earlier version of the stable cell.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.restates_market_benchmark_id IS 'Delivered-version key superseded by the selected restatement, when supplied.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.observed_at_ts IS 'Provider observation or publication timestamp for the selected version.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.provider_updated_at_ts IS 'Provider update timestamp used first in latest-wins ordering.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.load_timestamp IS 'Lakehouse load timestamp used after provider and observation timestamps in latest-wins ordering.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.market_share_basis IS 'Ratio basis used by the metric view: subject sales over matching total-category sales.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_market_share.license_posture IS 'Default internal-use-only boundary for licensed cells and their derivatives; adopters apply their own contracts.';

-- ---------- gold_product_affinity_pairwise (market-basket "frequently bought together") ----------
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.product_affinity_id IS 'Durable grain key for the directed pair: product_id_a|product_id_b|time_window.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.product_id_a IS 'Antecedent product (the durable business key). The "if a customer buys A" side.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.product_name_a IS 'Display name of product A (current product version; label only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.category_a IS 'Merchandising category of product A (current version; label only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.brand_a IS 'Brand of product A (current version; label only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.product_id_b IS 'Consequent product (the durable business key). The "...they also buy B" side.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.product_name_b IS 'Display name of product B (current product version; label only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.category_b IS 'Merchandising category of product B (current version; label only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.brand_b IS 'Brand of product B (current version; label only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.time_window IS 'The trailing window the rule was computed over: 30D / 90D / ALL_TIME, each anchored to MAX(order_date) (not current_date). support/confidence/lift are recomputed per window, so a pair can rank differently or drop out in a shorter window.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.computed_through_date IS 'The anchor the trailing windows trail from: MAX(order_date) in the data (same value on every row). A 30D row therefore covers computed_through_date - 30 days .. computed_through_date; makes the window end explicit for interpretability.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.cooccurrence_baskets IS 'Baskets (orders) containing BOTH A and B — the numerator for support and confidence.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.antecedent_baskets IS 'Baskets containing A (the confidence denominator).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.consequent_baskets IS 'Baskets containing B.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.total_baskets IS 'Distinct baskets (orders) in the window — the support denominator.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.support IS 'Support = cooccurrence_baskets / total_baskets: how common the pair is across all baskets (0..1).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.confidence IS 'Confidence(A->B) = cooccurrence_baskets / antecedent_baskets: P(B in basket | A in basket) (0..1). Directional.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.lift IS 'Lift = support(A,B) / (support(A) x support(B)): association strength vs. chance. > 1 = positive/meaningful, = 1 = independent, < 1 = substitutes.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_product_affinity_pairwise.is_mirrored_pair IS 'TRUE on the mirror copy (product_id_a > product_id_b). Filter to FALSE for one row per undirected pair; keep both for directional confidence.';

-- ---------- gold_customer_product_affinity (individualized customer -> product affinity) ----------
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.customer_product_affinity_id IS 'Durable grain key: profile_id|product_id.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.profile_id IS 'Durable, pseudonymous customer business key (not raw PII).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.product_id IS 'Durable product business key.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.product_name IS 'Display name of the product (current version; label only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.category IS 'Merchandising category (current version; label only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.subcategory IS 'Merchandising subcategory (current version; label only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.brand IS 'Brand (current version; label only).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.purchase_count IS 'Distinct orders (purchase occasions) the customer bought this product on.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.total_units IS 'Total units of this product the customer purchased.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.total_net_amount IS 'Total net spend on this product, in the reporting/base currency.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.currency_code IS 'Reporting/base currency of total_net_amount (ISO 4217).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.first_purchase_date IS 'Date of the customer''s first purchase of this product.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.last_purchase_date IS 'Date of the customer''s most recent purchase of this product.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.last_purchased_at IS 'Event-time (UTC) of the customer''s most recent PURCHASE of this product (MAX event_timestamp) — carries time-of-day, not midnight. Named for the single v1 driver (PURCHASE_HISTORY); a broader last_interacted_at spanning browse/ML interaction sources is a documented follow-on.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.days_since_last_purchase IS 'Days from the last purchase to as_of_date (MAX(order_date) in the data) — the input to recency decay.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.recency_weight IS 'Exponential time-decay weight pow(0.5, days_since_last_purchase / 90) in (0,1]. Half-life 90 days.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.affinity_score IS 'Purchase-history affinity in [0,1] = LEAST(1, purchase_intensity x recency_weight); purchase_intensity = LEAST(1, purchase_count / 5). Transparent heuristic, not an ML model.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.affinity_band IS 'Coarse affinity bucket: high (>= 0.6) / medium (>= 0.2) / low.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN ${catalog}.${acu_schema}.gold_customer_product_affinity.primary_driver IS 'What the affinity is derived from. v1 is always PURCHASE_HISTORY; BROWSE_BEHAVIOR and latent/embedding (ML) drivers are a documented follow-on.';
